  "title": "· Miu Miu Wander Small Crescent Bag ·",
  "original_title": "Miu Miu Wander 小号新月包",
  "excerpt": "Miu Miu's Wander handbag is a playful yet elegant crescent-shaped quilted leather piece from Spring/Summer 2022.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-06-10",
