    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Wander is Miu Miu's iconic handbag from the Spring/Summer 2022 collection, crafted from soft, puffy**Matelassé**quilted leather in a small, rounded crescent silhouette that balances playful and elegant vibes. The name \"Wander\" evokes roaming, exploring, and indulging curiosity—perfectly capturing the whimsical spirit of the Miu Miu girl.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
