      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "First unveiled in Miu Miu's Spring/Summer 2022 collection, the Wander bag is meticulously crafted from richly textured**Matelassé**leather. Its small crescent shape strikes a balance between fun and refinement, with smooth, flowing curves that echo feminine softness. The integrated handle is simple to carry, blending practicality with decoration, and giving women the freedom to wander at will.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
