    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Matelassé Quilted Leather ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**Matelassé**crinkled leather is one of Miu Miu's most iconic design elements, first introduced in Fall/Winter 2006. Using quilting techniques, the leather is shaped into a grain-like wrinkled texture, with padding inside to create a plush, voluminous feel.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "/images/wi7bb4g/838fed946f122a0d.jpg",
      "full_url": "/images/wi7bb4g/a6eba2c502e279c7.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "Zhou Xun in the Miu Miu Fall/Winter 2006 campaign",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The term**Matelassé**means \"quilted\" in French. Miuccia Prada cleverly applied this technique, rich in history, to a range of items—from entry-level small leather goods to popular bag styles—so that anyone seeing the signature leather texture instantly recognizes it as Miu Miu, cementing a powerful brand visual identity.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "/images/wi7bb4g/7c76d927dad030be.jpg",
      "full_url": "/images/wi7bb4g/d1debc54ce1b8445.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
      "url": null,
