    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "All**Matelassé**leather is made from soft, resilient nappa lambskin. Its pliable nature allows the elastic lining and padded interlayer to combine perfectly, remaining flawless even after quilting and stretching. The whole lambskin is precisely patterned and cut to the bag's shape, then quilted to create a warm, three-dimensional wrinkled texture.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "/images/wi7bb4g/f51f6d09fa92dafa.jpg",
      "full_url": "/images/wi7bb4g/abb0b6d4b662470a.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
