    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "Wander bag production process",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "To ensure the bag's integrity and aesthetics, the curved leather extending from the left and right sides of the Wander bag to the handle is made from a single piece—no seams. Every step, from stitching and assembly of the handle components to the final hardware, is done by hand by artisans.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
