    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· How to Wear This Bag ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The small, rounded hobo silhouette of the Wander bag allows for multiple carrying styles—handheld, crook-of-arm, or under the arm—giving off a playful, girlish vibe. It also comes with a detachable long strap, perfect for crossbody wear when traveling, freeing your hands while keeping that youthful, energetic Miu Miu spirit.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
