      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The interior is lined in black cotton satin—soft, lightweight, and stain-resistant. On the back side, a gold**MIU MIU**leather badge echoes the logo on the front.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
