    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We packed a compact mirror, phone, tissues, card case, earphones, perfume, lipstick, and a brooch—enough for a girl's daily essentials. Lightweight and practical for everyday outings, it works for shopping, dates, outdoor trips, or a day at the amusement park.",
