    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Miu Miu is an Italian luxury fashion brand from Milan, founded by fashion designer Miuccia Prada in 1993. It offers women's ready-to-wear, handbags, footwear, eyewear, fragrances, and accessories, targeting a young female clientele. Miu Miu's design team is based in Milan, Italy, while its corporate headquarters moved to Paris, France, in 2015. Since 1993 from Paris",
      "url": null,
